{"name":"Highlight","hex":"#eef0de","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"highlight","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An area or a spot in a drawing, painting, or photograph that is strongly illuminated.","An especially significant or interesting detail or event or period of time."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To make prominent; emphasize.","To be a highlight of."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/highlight"}],"entries":[{"title":"Specular highlight","blocks":[{"text":"A specular highlight is the bright spot of light that appears on shiny objects when illuminated. Specular highlights are important in 3D computer graphics, as they provide a strong visual cue for the shape of an object and its location with respect to light sources in the scene."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cd/Specular_highlight.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Specular_highlight","wikidata":"Q7575328"},{"title":"Hair highlighting","blocks":[{"text":"Hair highlighting/lowlighting is the practice of changing a person's hair color, using lightener or haircolor to lift the level or brightness of hair strands. Hair dyes primarily come in two different forms: oxidative (permanent) and non-oxidative. Permanent hair dyes bleach and add a new color to hair through the penetration of smaller dye precursors into the cortex and subsequent oxidation. There are four basic types of highlights: foil highlights, hair painting, frosting, and chunking. Highlights can be any color, as long as it is a lighter level than the surrounding hair. Hair lightened with bleach or permanent color will be permanent until new growth begins to show. Highlighted hair can make the hair appear fuller. Therefore, it is sometimes recommended for people with thin and fine hair."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hair_highlighting","wikidata":"Q2329734"},{"title":"Highlight (band)","blocks":[{"text":"Highlight, formerly known as Beast, is a South Korean boy band formed by Cube Entertainment. The band consists of four members: Yoon Doo-joon, Yang Yo-seob, Lee Gi-kwang, and Son Dong-woon. Highlight was originally a six-piece band; Jang Hyun-seung departed from the group in April 2016, and Yong Jun-hyung departed in March 2019. In late 2016, the group moved labels from Cube Entertainment to Around Us Entertainment and subsequently changed their name to Highlight in 2017."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Highlight_at_G-KPOP_2022.jpg/330px-Highlight_at_G-KPOP_2022.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Highlight_(band)","wikidata":"Q269595"},{"title":"Highlight (application)","blocks":[{"text":"Highlight was a social networking application for iOS and Android created by Paul Davison. The application finds nearby users and shows things they have in common with a user. The application received a large update which introduced Android support on November 20, 2012. On April 30, 2015, the developers announced a change of focus towards social networking via photo-sharing through their Roll app."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Highlight_(application)","wikidata":"Q5759470"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e6/Hair-Spray-Painting-6415.jpg/500px-Hair-Spray-Painting-6415.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e6/Hair-Spray-Painting-6415.jpg/1280px-Hair-Spray-Painting-6415.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e6/Hair-Spray-Painting-6415.jpg/500px-Hair-Spray-Painting-6415.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Coloring a young girl's hair with temporary spray paint","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AHair-Spray-Painting-6415.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/Beast_at_Lotte_Giants_2010_Special_Concert_100321.jpg/500px-Beast_at_Lotte_Giants_2010_Special_Concert_100321.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/Beast_at_Lotte_Giants_2010_Special_Concert_100321.jpg/500px-Beast_at_Lotte_Giants_2010_Special_Concert_100321.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Beast performing in 2010.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABeast_at_Lotte_Giants_2010_Special_Concert_100321.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c7/BEAST_at_the_Expo_2012_Yeosu.JPG/500px-BEAST_at_the_Expo_2012_Yeosu.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c7/BEAST_at_the_Expo_2012_Yeosu.JPG/500px-BEAST_at_the_Expo_2012_Yeosu.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Beast performing at the Expo 2012.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABEAST_at_the_Expo_2012_Yeosu.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8a/14.11.23_%EB%A9%9C%EB%A1%A0_%EB%AE%A4%EC%A7%81_%EC%96%B4%EC%9B%8C%EB%93%9C_%EC%8B%9C%EC%83%81_%EB%B0%8F_%EC%88%98%EC%83%81.jpg/500px-14.11.23_%EB%A9%9C%EB%A1%A0_%EB%AE%A4%EC%A7%81_%EC%96%B4%EC%9B%8C%EB%93%9C_%EC%8B%9C%EC%83%81_%EB%B0%8F_%EC%88%98%EC%83%81.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8a/14.11.23_%EB%A9%9C%EB%A1%A0_%EB%AE%A4%EC%A7%81_%EC%96%B4%EC%9B%8C%EB%93%9C_%EC%8B%9C%EC%83%81_%EB%B0%8F_%EC%88%98%EC%83%81.jpg/1280px-14.11.23_%EB%A9%9C%EB%A1%A0_%EB%AE%A4%EC%A7%81_%EC%96%B4%EC%9B%8C%EB%93%9C_%EC%8B%9C%EC%83%81_%EB%B0%8F_%EC%88%98%EC%83%81.jpg?utm_source=